    <path d="M10.7778 13.1111H10V10H9.22222M10 6.88889H10.0078M17 10C17 13.866 13.866 17 10 17C6.13401 17 3 13.866 3 10C3 6.13401 6.13401 3 10 3C13.866 3 17 6.13401 17 10Z"
