                                    <span class="Barlow Text2">What metrics does the Rapsodo MLM2PRO™ measure? </span></div>
                                <div class="panel">
                <span class="Barlow Text5 FaqAnswers scroll-trigger animate--fade-in">
                  <p>The MLM2PRO™ provides 15 metrics including:  </p><p>Angle of Attack (measured)  </p><p>Club Path (measured)  <br/>Ball Speed (measured)  <br/>Club Speed (measured) <br/>Smash Factor  <br/>Launch Angle (measured) <br/>Launch Direction (measured) <br/>Carry Distance  <br/>Total Distance  <br/>Spin Rate (measured) <br/>Spin Axis (measured) <br/>Descent Angle  <br/>Side Carry  <br/>Apex  <br/>Shot Type  </p>
                  
                </span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                       
                        
                 

                

                           
                        
                    
                            <div class="AccordionContent FlexColumn JustifyContentCenter AlignFlexStart scroll-trigger animate--fade-in">
                                <div class="Accordion">
