                                    <span class="Barlow Text2">What are the set up requirements for outdoor use?</span></div>
                                <div class="panel">
                <span class="Barlow Text5 FaqAnswers scroll-trigger animate--fade-in">
                  <p>The MLM2PRO™ is designed to sit 6.5-8.5 feet directly behind the ball aimed down the target line.   </p>
                  
                </span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                       
                        
                 

                

                           
                        
                    
