                                                  stroke-width="1.67" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                                        </svg>
                                    </div>
                                    <span class="Barlow Text2">Can I use a projector or smart TV with simulation?</span></div>
                                <div class="panel">
                <span class="Barlow Text5 FaqAnswers scroll-trigger animate--fade-in">
                  <p>Yes, for projection with an iOS device: Use a lightning cable to HDMI to projector.  <br/>If using an Android device: Use a USB-C to an HDMI to projector. <br/>For a Smart TV, you will Airplay or Screen Mirror to the Smart TV from either your iOS or Android device. </p>
                  
                </span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                       
                        
                 

                

